            "text": "Decoder memory safety — unsigned underflow to allocation/memcpy size — Requires further review: src/mqtt.c unpack_mqtt_publish (payloadlen arithmetic)\n\nCONFIRMED BY TRACE. mqtt.c:314 len -= (2 + topiclen) on usize with no check that 2+topiclen <= len; mqtt.c:316 unpack_bytes(&buf, len) -> pack.c:413 try_alloc(len+1) + pack.c:414 memcpy(dest,*buf,len). len == SIZE_MAX makes try_alloc(0) succeed and memcpy(SIZE_MAX) fault; other magnitudes make malloc fail -> exit(EXIT_FAILURE) (memory.c:49-53). 7-byte PoC `30 05 00 04 41 41 41` (and `30 05 00 FF 41 41 41` for the exit variant) in note 1cc769.</evidence>"
