        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/null-pointer-dereference-during-wildcard-match",
          "ruleIndex": 30,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "NULL pointer dereference during wildcard match — Ruled out: handlers.c match_subscription wildcard matcher\n\nNamed control, with its own bug: match_subscription's only caller is the loop body at handlers.c:720-736, guarded by if (topic_store_wildcards_empty(server.store)) at handlers.c:719. The body therefore runs only when the wildcard list is empty, so no iteration ever reaches the ptopic=index(...); ptopic[0] NULL deref at handlers.c:290-295. Unreachable while the inverted guard exists (repairing the guard would make it reachable - see the recorded wildcard finding)."
          },
