          "message": {
            "text": "Dynamic testability (build & run harness, sanitizer instrumentation) — No issue identified: sol broker local build + execution (build.sh / run.sh / mqttclient.py / test_smoke.py)\n\nBuilt out of tree (cmake 4.3.4 + gcc 16.2, -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 for the 2.8 policy floor): build-asan/sol (ASan+UBSan, zero warnings) and build-dev/sol (-O2 -g). Ran both on 127.0.0.1: anonymous and password-file modes start, accept MQTT CONNECT/SUBSCRIBE/PUBLISH, and shut down via SIGTERM in ~63 ms. test_smoke.py passes 9/9 on anon (asan) and on auth (correct creds -> CONNACK 0, wrong/missing -> 4). ASan/UBSan abort-on-error reports land in run/<name>/asan/report.<pid> with symbolized traces (verified end to end)."
          },
