          "message": {
            "text": "Pre-auth NULL dereference DoS (unauthenticated SUBSCRIBE) — Requires further review: Pre-CONNECT SUBSCRIBE (src/handlers.c subscribe_handler, line 589 topic_add_subscriber)\n\nCONFIRMED, report not filed here. subscribe_handler has no connected check; topic_add_subscriber -> subscriber_new (src/subscriber.c:45) memcpy's from the NULL client->session. Pre-CONNECT `82 10 00 01 00 0b plv/preauth 00` gives PEER-CLOSED and UBsan \"member access within null pointer of type 'struct client_session'\" (subscriber.c:45 -> topic.c:92 -> handlers.c:588); dev build SIGSEGV, also in the default allow_anonymous=true config. PoC /workspace/poc/poc_preauth_publish.py unauth-subscribe, evidence /workspace/poc/evidence/02_preauth_authz.txt."
