          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Configured resource limit not enforced — Requires further review: Operator config max_memory (src/config.c:228, src/server.c:236)\n\nConfirmed by source and by measurement: max_memory is parsed (config.c:228-229) and only read back for the $SOL stats payload (server.c:236 memory_used()); no allocation path consults it. A broker configured with max_memory 8MB kept running at 87 MB VmRSS after 10 clean_session=0 connections (10x over the cap) and only died when RLIMIT_AS made malloc fail (memory.c:51 exit). Recorded as a supporting fact for the memory-exhaustion finding, not as an independent vulnerability."
