          "kind": "open",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Fail-open credential comparison — Requires further review: check_passwd() empty stored hash / strncasecmp hash comparison (src/util.c:142)\n\nConfirmed: with a password_file entry `emptyuser:` (empty hash field) any password is accepted - arbitrary, empty and 60-char passwords all returned CONNACK rc=0 while the control user alice still returned rc=4. Cause: strlen(salt)==0 makes strncasecmp(...,0)==0. Confirmed but NOT filed as a report (task instruction); parent should decide reporting. Severity: low - requires an operator-written password file with an empty hash field."
